            "verseEn": "Do they associate with Him those who create nothing and they are [themselves] created?"
          },
          {
            "ar": "نَصْرًا",
            "en": "any help",
            "ref": "7:192",
            "verse": "وَلَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ لَهُمْ نَصْرًۭا وَلَآ أَنفُسَهُمْ يَنصُرُونَ",
            "verseEn": "And they [i.e., the false deities] are unable to [give] them help, nor can they help themselves."
          },
          {
